v4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Breakfast & Brunch, French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Coffee & Tea, Food","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"French, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","review_id":"TaQaLTGdNK0mn93K03PCrg","date":"2017-03-07T22:53:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9371524453163147,"text_excerpt":"Simply beautiful. This place got a lot of things right but one thing they absolutely hit out of the park was the decor and ambiance! The dining is situated upstairs with the desserts being downstairs--more on this later. In a minute's gaze of the second floor, I found this place to be the premier spot to have a bridal luncheon/ladies who brunch spot..everything is so delicately beautiful and not to mention the unique tea offerings with finger sandwiches that would add such a sweet touch to a ladies' celebration. But, don't fret, you don't have to be part of a girls' club to dine here. I noticed a lot of small and large groups and my party itself was on the larger side. Together, there wer..."},{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","review_id":"WCEiWDSwpfmE24SoBZc5yw","date":"2017-01-22T17:01:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9332704544067383,"text_excerpt":"We had brunch here the Saturday of Rees dress run. The ambience here can only be described as clean and fresh and very modern. They have bottomless mimosas for $25. They do keep it filled the whole time. Service was fantastic. And the food was better than I expected considering it's more of a dessert place or at least that's what I thought. I ordered the Croque Benedict which is Southern Chive Biscuit, Mornay, Soft Boiled Egg, Raclette, Crystal Hollandaise with apple Ham. It's like an open faced breakfast sandwich. It was incredibly rich and so delicious. In fact I had dreams about it it was so good. Even their cocktails are pretty. Everything at sucre is made up to look so pretty. I can'..."},{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","review_id":"5L6It2CogjL6f-VETkU99g","date":"2016-05-15T22:18:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9288311004638672,"text_excerpt":"I went to Salon's tea with my parents. I am a huge fan of Sucre and get their macaroons often. Whenever I'm walking around the French Quarter I stop in for their delicious and decadent gelato as well. The restaurant did not disappoint. The tea selection was vast and came out on an adorable little cart. The food was cute and delicious. Signature to Sucre's style they were just little bites of heaven and not an overwhelming amount of food. The only issue was that it was not meant to be split between 3 people. We did the tea prix fixe and still had to order another dish just to make sure there was going to be enough food as this was a late lunch for us. All in all still very good."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","photo_id":"xQVnAEbADLbhIFfPOUcGAQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/xQVnAEbADLbhIFfPOUcGAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9094574451446533},{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","photo_id":"JtWWv1sIVJuUi9BP0gWGkg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JtWWv1sIVJuUi9BP0gWGkg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8968287706375122},{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","photo_id":"LCBvIRpVjfu8zUuy0nXvxw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LCBvIRpVjfu8zUuy0nXvxw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8330214619636536},{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","photo_id":"tTgrUaDaRQxAua3XFnbeYw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/tTgrUaDaRQxAua3XFnbeYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8079814910888672},{"business_id":"b0zp6rgcv7ZcjToRoVhcmQ","photo_id":"Q15fUALrestTh87A_e7o1A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/Q15fUALrestTh87A_e7o1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7666908502578735}]},"notebook_case":null}
